From ed9f0b73b287e7a15f85c7db4474d66d69a87f2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:12:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] merge-manager-watcher: the sweep (cadence, steps, helper,
 pre-approval ledger)

Owner ruling, 2026-11-07 (card, about 07:55Z): document and tool the merge
manager's sweep.

- Cadence: every 10-15 minutes while a P0 is in flight, 30 otherwise;
  "What wakes it" and the diagram's wake step now say the same.
- One sweep: merge:watch over every repository, each green request's six
  lines in chat, one batch card, merge or train-label what is approved,
  landed:/back: to the waiting sessions, heartbeat, re-arm.
- A helper may tabulate (step 1) and never writes.
- The pre-approval ledger: "merge when green" for a named PR, recorded on
  the coordination work item beside the merge manager note; no second card.
- Heartbeat is posted with each sweep; requests are acknowledged within
  about 10 minutes (actor description and diagram text aligned).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQDpPc2tT1vUufdyDbQTBz
