 msgid "Every check run on the head SHA has finished, and anything pending blocks; wait for every tier, e2e included. The full tier ran (the No new failures judge, or every full test shard); a draft or fast-tier-only pass never counts. Every judge passes (owner ruling, 2026-11-07): an aggregate job covers only the parts it names, and each test shard's own no-new-failures table lists 0 new failures; with no judge, each check concluded success, skipped or neutral. A cancelled job counts only when a later run of the same workflow on the same head passed that job. merge:watch prints this verdict per PR."
